  "problem": "The fifth-degree Taylor polynomial of $f(x)$ about $x=-2$ is given by\n\n$$\n{P}_{5}(x)=-3+5(x+2)-7(x+2)^{2}+9(x+2)^{3}-11(x+2)^{4}+13(x+2)^{5}.\n$$\n\nWhat is ${f}^{(5)}(-2)?$",
